INDEX ./
The plan system: a plan kept as a tree of buckets and drawn as a graph; starts with an empty plan.

F LICENSE           MIT licence (GitHub's, made with the repo)
F LICENCE.TXT       MIT licence the file headers point to
F NOTICE            Third-party software bundled (Cytoscape, fcose, cose-base, layout-base)
F CLAUDE.md         Working rules for a Claude Code session here: talk first, no popups, branches, compliance, indexes, the plan skills
F README.md         Front door: what is here, how to load the page, what is known as copied
F manifest.json     Chrome extension manifest (MV3): the plan graph page as an extension
F background.js     Service worker: the toolbar button opens html/plan.html
F index.cld         This index
D .claude/          Claude Code project files: the plan skills
D config/           Error-framework config the page loads
D docs/             Longer documents (dear-liza)
D html/             The plan graph page
D lib/              The page's controller, error framework and graph libraries
D licence/          Full licence texts of the bundled libraries
D notes/            The plan, its spec and the skills guide
D scripts/          The compliance checker
